  "title": "Add Shadows to Text [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "文章に影をつける【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "0469a26e04bab0c84abe5f036b4316de51216afb25a17ba349b54bc5048c0e04",
      "translation": "Add Shadows to Text [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "0469a26e04bab0c84abe5f036b4316de51216afb25a17ba349b54bc5048c0e04"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "文章に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "0968116b849a15d49c8b042afdaee4da520effa058fbd62d5914814e08becb76",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to text.",
      "contextHash": "0968116b849a15d49c8b042afdaee4da520effa058fbd62d5914814e08becb76"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、影の描画には標準に存在する文字の縁取りを利用しています。",
      "sourceHash": "e2ecd83a25e312f4e1ea9a0b65c50187b98b13b1746b8f3e1049f3f7fa7cb02b",
      "translation": "The shadows are drawn using the standard text outline.",
      "contextHash": "e2ecd83a25e312f4e1ea9a0b65c50187b98b13b1746b8f3e1049f3f7fa7cb02b"
    },
    {
