      "source": "プラグインパラメータ",
      "sourceHash": "356c245db542a792ed22807f25f0f5d6b8db3fbb2069ca24851ed2c2846610b8",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters",
      "contextHash": "356c245db542a792ed22807f25f0f5d6b8db3fbb2069ca24851ed2c2846610b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "標準の縁取りを残す（DrawDefaultOutline）",
      "sourceHash": "7913f4a132b51f46cd01d9173832bbbbc5f109bf0ebea9fda53f18116767c89f",
      "translation": "Keep the Default Outline (DrawDefaultOutline)",
      "contextHash": "7913f4a132b51f46cd01d9173832bbbbc5f109bf0ebea9fda53f18116767c89f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "標準に存在する文字の縁取りを残します。",
      "sourceHash": "190a2ab5e6159dc306dcd1c413f7735be9ca001ba038b5088602f68524908eaa",
      "translation": "Keeps the standard text outline.",
      "contextHash": "190a2ab5e6159dc306dcd1c413f7735be9ca001ba038b5088602f68524908eaa"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "影のサイズ調整（ShadowAdjustSize）",
      "sourceHash": "34c465e26f1434d5af06aafc25932d2e4c253d463422fababb5eb5e8aa7be133",
      "translation": "Adjust Shadow Size (ShadowAdjustSize)",
      "contextHash": "34c465e26f1434d5af06aafc25932d2e4c253d463422fababb5eb5e8aa7be133"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "文字の影のサイズです。",
      "sourceHash": "d2a5659e1f93e688d60e331bc96a4fe108dacdb94fc759b4578542132e7af3ca",
      "translation": "The size of the text shadow.",
      "contextHash": "d2a5659e1f93e688d60e331bc96a4fe108dacdb94fc759b4578542132e7af3ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "0で文字本体と同じになります。",
      "sourceHash": "18225f0ea5e15862eb2f8135d7a3462653748655bd0c3e544ac8327a7609dbd9",
      "translation": "Set this to 0 to use the same size as the text itself.",
      "contextHash": "18225f0ea5e15862eb2f8135d7a3462653748655bd0c3e544ac8327a7609dbd9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "影のＸ座標調整（ShadowAdjustX）",
      "sourceHash": "71af827390dbda3ab26aab97deb4d70c8228d2a68233cd14b8de2bd323b4fac5",
      "translation": "Adjust Shadow X Coordinate (ShadowAdjustX)",
      "contextHash": "71af827390dbda3ab26aab97deb4d70c8228d2a68233cd14b8de2bd323b4fac5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "文字の影のＸ座標の差分値です。",
      "sourceHash": "70bfcbdecf9aed3f450ec3f775cbad64c18875467d8ce90da9401cb586d37e00",
      "translation": "The difference in the text shadow's X coordinate.",
      "contextHash": "70bfcbdecf9aed3f450ec3f775cbad64c18875467d8ce90da9401cb586d37e00"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "影のＹ座標調整（ShadowAdjustY）",
      "sourceHash": "dec41a0afe53ff8e56c5c7ac64227217909550db8d1a703fef763eaa36d02f89",
      "translation": "Adjust Shadow Y Coordinate (ShadowAdjustY)",
      "contextHash": "dec41a0afe53ff8e56c5c7ac64227217909550db8d1a703fef763eaa36d02f89"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "文字の影のＹ座標の差分値です。",
      "sourceHash": "7a1d090daef5e4d584ccec5e1fe14b5dc2ed623a4dd5d208f9af7e0b1500d503",
      "translation": "The difference in the text shadow's Y coordinate.",
      "contextHash": "7a1d090daef5e4d584ccec5e1fe14b5dc2ed623a4dd5d208f9af7e0b1500d503"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "影の色（ShadowColor）",
      "sourceHash": "66c4a0391c439cf82f52f9edff239cb8f65e488ba0b4346718191667aa062f86",
      "translation": "Shadow Color (ShadowColor)",
      "contextHash": "66c4a0391c439cf82f52f9edff239cb8f65e488ba0b4346718191667aa062f86"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "文字の影色のＲＧＢＡ値（赤、緑、青、不透明度）です。",
      "sourceHash": "981e00d9187796348130495490528796fc4eaab26e9f6cc6d5e6a3303af84793",
      "translation": "The RGBA value (red, green, blue, and opacity) of the text shadow color.",
      "contextHash": "981e00d9187796348130495490528796fc4eaab26e9f6cc6d5e6a3303af84793"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "各色を00~FFまでの16進数で入力してください。",
      "sourceHash": "6d688e78c633c2b9df94fec8c4a227925ae8076050d640bfca5b8b87be907ec8",
      "translation": "Enter each color as a hexadecimal value from 00 to FF.",
      "contextHash": "6d688e78c633c2b9df94fec8c4a227925ae8076050d640bfca5b8b87be907ec8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期値の『#00000080』は黒かつ不透明度が５０％になります。",
      "sourceHash": "4f035993b007ec19494b39e782403c74fbf51c4d337eee42e1ac06fa452dbcf2",
      "translation": "The default value, \"#00000080\", produces black with 50% opacity.",
      "contextHash": "4f035993b007ec19494b39e782403c74fbf51c4d337eee42e1ac06fa452dbcf2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "【対象】",
      "sourceHash": "b5cf5f5b9b1dfe8324c0e8f3862214950ac0744302e67f43b2608b465f6c02c6",
      "translation": "[Target]",
      "contextHash": "b5cf5f5b9b1dfe8324c0e8f3862214950ac0744302e67f43b2608b465f6c02c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "文字に影をつける範囲を変更可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "7ffeb7e5683007a0d555c117510cee94ab8f966b38bd1bf492393ad776a7e690",
      "translation": "You can change which text receives shadows.",
      "contextHash": "7ffeb7e5683007a0d555c117510cee94ab8f966b38bd1bf492393ad776a7e690"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期状態では全ての文字に適用されますので、ご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "a69b2f2109045634517597667bb48b4357432ada109324bfda5f3f3ef8ec6e80",
      "translation": "By default, this applies to all text, so please be careful.",
      "contextHash": "a69b2f2109045634517597667bb48b4357432ada109324bfda5f3f3ef8ec6e80"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "全て（All）",
      "sourceHash": "1e30b7c0e2d56159a18e2351e92aaf9b04650783e03a8f01625d3225f13ad145",
      "translation": "All (All)",
      "contextHash": "1e30b7c0e2d56159a18e2351e92aaf9b04650783e03a8f01625d3225f13ad145"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "全ての文字に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "2f81c72af89c083b9fbe63bb90580adeee63298a4ea297a7603e6a1ec8eb2fb0",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to all text.",
      "contextHash": "2f81c72af89c083b9fbe63bb90580adeee63298a4ea297a7603e6a1ec8eb2fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "これがオンの場合は以降の項目も全てオンとして扱います。",
      "sourceHash": "9cda1f3fad68f566e1b65ca1a1e3734a9f8162f1766a07dddeea9b6ccf8bae45",
      "translation": "When this is enabled, all subsequent options are also treated as enabled.",
      "contextHash": "9cda1f3fad68f566e1b65ca1a1e3734a9f8162f1766a07dddeea9b6ccf8bae45"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※Bitmap.prototype.drawTextを経由する全ての文字が対象です。",
      "sourceHash": "a370e6bda1a0e43f001f1a5c2d9ecc18f01e98b76ed94c1785b291921b14069b",
      "translation": "※All text processed through Bitmap.prototype.drawText is affected.",
      "contextHash": "a370e6bda1a0e43f001f1a5c2d9ecc18f01e98b76ed94c1785b291921b14069b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "全ウィンドウ（AllWindows）",
      "sourceHash": "a4f969c236ffc7440628a21eb9f6f6fa71f2860f727bcddf60a0d0774ee66e94",
      "translation": "All Windows (AllWindows)",
      "contextHash": "a4f969c236ffc7440628a21eb9f6f6fa71f2860f727bcddf60a0d0774ee66e94"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "全ウィンドウの文字に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "43740224923903e7b1b0e62922ecc6d945145910f2d03fac2bebf1d511e6dfcd",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to text in all windows.",
      "contextHash": "43740224923903e7b1b0e62922ecc6d945145910f2d03fac2bebf1d511e6dfcd"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ただし、ステータス系には反映されないものがあります。",
      "sourceHash": "fe00a16ed6a5aced81a320036ea828cc732a357225f73a64d8b71defe1c2df0e",
      "translation": "However, this does not apply to some status-related text.",
      "contextHash": "fe00a16ed6a5aced81a320036ea828cc732a357225f73a64d8b71defe1c2df0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "メッセージウィンドウ（MessageWindow）",
      "sourceHash": "3fa4bf580a1fa0f3bd831142369e9b835b8949cd43de3b6224c40e707091df4a",
      "translation": "Message Window (MessageWindow)",
      "contextHash": "3fa4bf580a1fa0f3bd831142369e9b835b8949cd43de3b6224c40e707091df4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "メッセージウィンドウの文字に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "b4e2b64c2808ec3e3e29bc28ffa6a6323b765453fe61206f18b358cb4f5d92fa",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to text in the message window.",
      "contextHash": "b4e2b64c2808ec3e3e29bc28ffa6a6323b765453fe61206f18b358cb4f5d92fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "名前ウィンドウ（NameWindow）",
      "sourceHash": "c4a141b00e2f592110ac11426b775db76d3022a05d9d36fbb30d144c3ed2e722",
      "translation": "Name Window (NameWindow)",
      "contextHash": "c4a141b00e2f592110ac11426b775db76d3022a05d9d36fbb30d144c3ed2e722"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "名前ウィンドウの文字に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "3d9378b8093ab202f9403f64c690ee30a9304d525335df78cdffaa29ae160258",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to text in the name window.",
      "contextHash": "3d9378b8093ab202f9403f64c690ee30a9304d525335df78cdffaa29ae160258"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、ＭＶでは名前欄が存在しないため意味がありません。",
      "sourceHash": "d2082e3838a05c2673cddda014d0a87b8452c499df8b398711cb61576e5a2dde",
      "translation": "This has no effect in MV because it does not have a name field.",
      "contextHash": "d2082e3838a05c2673cddda014d0a87b8452c499df8b398711cb61576e5a2dde"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ステータスの名前（StatusName）",
      "sourceHash": "8b58928bfcfb21052c1456730c62f531a88f6b918c175c9f5ac2eebeccdfddba",
      "translation": "Status Name (StatusName)",
      "contextHash": "8b58928bfcfb21052c1456730c62f531a88f6b918c175c9f5ac2eebeccdfddba"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ステータスのアクター名に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "151590e8b55813a889573dc6cd4845894b968485d49c051d1f56246aa9cf5515",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to actor names in the status window.",
      "contextHash": "151590e8b55813a889573dc6cd4845894b968485d49c051d1f56246aa9cf5515"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ステータスのゲージ項目（StatusGauges）",
      "sourceHash": "b0ff7be7bd5eeae6015728973042a611195b7b13b3f79bb49a30b8d12b0e699a",
      "translation": "Status Gauge Items (StatusGauges)",
      "contextHash": "b0ff7be7bd5eeae6015728973042a611195b7b13b3f79bb49a30b8d12b0e699a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ステータスのゲージ項目（ラベル）に影をつけます。",
      "sourceHash": "6d6e86c7b0bbbafba1c1a76c3fafd6aac27c8dfa0dbfdf0b19733064d95e8744",
      "translation": "Adds shadows to status gauge items (labels).",
      "contextHash": "6d6e86c7b0bbbafba1c1a76c3fafd6aac27c8dfa0dbfdf0b19733064d95e8744"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "例えば、[[LINK_1]]立ち絵プラグイン（NRP_MessagePicture.js）[[/LINK_1]]と組み合わせた際に、ピクチャより上に表示されている文字を見やすくするといった使い方を想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "38e8d9977d5aa1efa99b53a8f8d51db87490cb4a408cb3a776a9ad09675ab987",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "例えば、",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "立ち絵プラグイン（NRP_MessagePicture.js）",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "と組み合わせた際に、ピクチャより上に表示されている文字を見やすくするといった使い方を想定しています。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "For example, I envision using it in combination with the [[LINK_1]]character portrait plugin (NRP_MessagePicture.js)[[/LINK_1]] to make text displayed above pictures easier to read.",
      "contextHash": "38e8d9977d5aa1efa99b53a8f8d51db87490cb4a408cb3a776a9ad09675ab987"
    },
